  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "1403401",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the church in the capital",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140340101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140340101": {
            "id": "140340101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "Finally, you arrive at the chu{RUBY#[D]Basement}rch Florian described.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340102"
            ]
          },
          "140340102": {
            "id": "140340102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "As you approach, an ominous aura surrounds you. You get the sense that your enemy is close at hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340103"
            ]
          },
          "140340103": {
            "id": "140340103",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "(How strange... This uneasy feeling seems so real. How did they manage that?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340104"
            ]
          },
          "140340104": {
            "id": "140340104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "Now... it is time for the final battle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340105"
            ]
          },
          "140340105": {
            "id": "140340105",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Let's go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340106"
            ]
          },
          "140340106": {
            "id": "140340106",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Florian, wait.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340107"
            ]
          },
          "140340107": {
            "id": "140340107",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340108"
            ]
          },
          "140340108": {
            "id": "140340108",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "I think you should wait outside. You've already been corrupted by the Devorator once. It could easily re-enter your mind and take control of your body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340109"
            ]
          },
          "140340109": {
            "id": "140340109",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "I don't think it's a good idea for you to be this close. If it corrupts you again, it's possible you might take on a new form entirely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340110"
            ]
          },
          "140340110": {
            "id": "140340110",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "That's exactly why I have to go... why I should be at the very front.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340111"
            ]
          },
          "140340111": {
            "id": "140340111",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "...! You mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340112"
            ]
          },
          "140340112": {
            "id": "140340112",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "Yes, I intend to lure it into my body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340113"
            ]
          },
          "140340113": {
            "id": "140340113",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "That's too risky. If things get out of hand, I might have to kill you. Do you understand how dangerous this is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340114"
            ]
          },
          "140340114": {
            "id": "140340114",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "I understand. But if I do this, you'll have a clear and visible target.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340115"
            ]
          },
          "140340115": {
            "id": "140340115",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "The Devorator will have a hard time passing up the chance to enter a body it knows how to control. You won't have to worry about any of your friends being taken over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340116"
            ]
          },
          "140340116": {
            "id": "140340116",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340117"
            ]
          },
          "140340117": {
            "id": "140340117",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "You're not like me, Miss Clorinde. You're a just and powerful Marechaussee Hunter. This monster broke free due to my error. It's only right that I shoulder the responsibility for its destruction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340118"
            ]
          },
          "140340118": {
            "id": "140340118",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "This is... something that I have to do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340119"
            ]
          },
          "140340119": {
            "id": "140340119",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "Consider it a duel to restore my honor. My only request is that you give it your all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340120"
            ]
          },
          "140340120": {
            "id": "140340120",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "...I understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340121"
            ]
          },
          "140340121": {
            "id": "140340121",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Then, as a Champion Duelist, I hereby accept your request for a duel, and extend to you my most sincere regards.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340122"
            ]
          },
          "140340122": {
            "id": "140340122",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340123"
            ]
          },
          "140340123": {
            "id": "140340123",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "The battle is now upon us. Let the Devorator once again tremble under the blade of the Marechaussee Hunters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1403402",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the church in the capital",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140340201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140340201": {
            "id": "140340201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "And so, the monsters were eradicated, and the sorcerer was defeated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340202"
            ]
          },
          "140340202": {
            "id": "140340202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "Peace soon returned to the capital. Those in the court manipulated by the sorcerer also recognized the errors of their ways...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340203"
            ]
          },
          "140340203": {
            "id": "140340203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "Some remembered the names of the heroes who saved their kingdom, but others simply continued their lives none the wiser.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340204"
            ]
          },
          "140340204": {
            "id": "140340204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "Such is the story of the Marechaussee Hunters. They pursue the phantoms in the darkness and exterminate all who pose a threat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340205"
            ]
          },
          "140340205": {
            "id": "140340205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Game Master",
            "text": "They will always protect the city and those within it, even should all memory of their accomplishments be forgotten by the very people they serve.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340206"
            ]
          },
          "140340206": {
            "id": "140340206",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Whew... I'm assuming we've finally reached the end of the script?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340207"
            ]
          },
          "140340207": {
            "id": "140340207",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Yes. You've reached one of the better endings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340208"
            ]
          },
          "140340208": {
            "id": "140340208",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "It's a pretty solid story overall. I thought it was just an ordinary adventure at first, but the further we got into it, the more impressed I became with the production and the plot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340209"
            ]
          },
          "140340209": {
            "id": "140340209",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "That final battle especially! All the effects were super realistic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340210"
            ]
          },
          "140340210": {
            "id": "140340210",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Right, yeah, hehe... totally.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340211"
            ]
          },
          "140340211": {
            "id": "140340211",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Ah... That's a really good point. I never expected the weapons we picked up from that vault would have that kind of effect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340212"
            ]
          },
          "140340212": {
            "id": "140340212",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Yeah, mine nearly scared the daylights out of me when it started glowing! I took a good look at it after we got out, but I don't think it ever lit up again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340213"
            ]
          },
          "140340213": {
            "id": "140340213",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Oh, we should probably give these props back, right? I'll just leave mine here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340214"
            ]
          },
          "140340214": {
            "id": "140340214",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Did you have a good time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340215"
            ]
          },
          "140340215": {
            "id": "140340215",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Of course. Let me know if another script like this comes around!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340216"
            ]
          },
          "140340216": {
            "id": "140340216",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Sure, no problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340217"
            ]
          },
          "140340217": {
            "id": "140340217",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Then, I'll head back for now. I think I need some time to fully digest everything that just happened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340218"
            ]
          },
          "140340218": {
            "id": "140340218",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Once Mr. Florian is awake, please pass on my regards to him. He must be extremely exhausted, to have passed out cold like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340219"
            ]
          },
          "140340219": {
            "id": "140340219",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "You're right. He's had a lot to deal with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340220"
            ]
          },
          "140340220": {
            "id": "140340220",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Well, see you all some other time! Toodle-oo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340221"
            ]
          },
          "140340221": {
            "id": "140340221",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "...Okay, so, can I ask now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340222"
            ]
          },
          "140340222": {
            "id": "140340222",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "I think it should be fine, yeah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340223"
            ]
          },
          "140340223": {
            "id": "140340223",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "What in the world was going on back there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340224"
            ]
          },
          "140340224": {
            "id": "140340224",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "...Ah, so you saw through all of that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340225"
            ]
          },
          "140340225": {
            "id": "140340225",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Ahahaha... That time in the cave when you told us to close our eyes... It'd be weirder if we didn't notice anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340226"
            ]
          },
          "140340226": {
            "id": "140340226",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "I was dying of curiosity the entire time! I mean, you did a pretty bang-up job of pretending nothing had gone wrong. Furina actually looked like she thought all of it was planned...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340227"
            ]
          },
          "140340227": {
            "id": "140340227",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Guess none of us wanted to be the one to break the illusion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340228"
            ]
          },
          "140340228": {
            "id": "140340228",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What are you all talking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340230",
              "140340232"
            ]
          },
          "140340230": {
            "id": "140340230",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Wait, don't tell me you never...! Ah, this is all my fault. It's not too late to cover your ears! Here, partner, I'll do it for you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340233"
            ]
          },
          "140340233": {
            "id": "140340233",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Um... Bit late for that, don't you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340234"
            ]
          },
          "140340234": {
            "id": "140340234",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... You're saying... Everything that happened back there wasn't actually part of the script?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340235"
            ]
          },
          "140340235": {
            "id": "140340235",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "It's probably more accurate to say this was never a real scripted story to begin with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340236"
            ]
          },
          "140340236": {
            "id": "140340236",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whaaat!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340237"
            ]
          },
          "140340237": {
            "id": "140340237",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...So loud... My head...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340238"
            ]
          },
          "140340238": {
            "id": "140340238",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, you! Get up right now and explain yourself!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340239"
            ]
          },
          "140340239": {
            "id": "140340239",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "Ahhhhh! No shaking, please! My head...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340240"
            ]
          },
          "140340240": {
            "id": "140340240",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Florian explains the truth to everyone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340241"
            ]
          },
          "140340241": {
            "id": "140340241",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "D—Did Paimon just hear that right? You guys made up that whole last part on the spot?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340242"
            ]
          },
          "140340242": {
            "id": "140340242",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's not nice to lie to people, but.... Paimon's gotta admit, that was a really good story, Florian. Oh, and nice improvisation, Clorinde!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340243"
            ]
          },
          "140340243": {
            "id": "140340243",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Yeah! It was like watching a magician improvise a spectacular magic trick after forgetting an important prop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340244"
            ]
          },
          "140340244": {
            "id": "140340244",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If Paimon knew something was wrong with that vault, she would've floated straight in the opposite direction!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340245"
            ]
          },
          "140340245": {
            "id": "140340245",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Everything was under control.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340246"
            ]
          },
          "140340246": {
            "id": "140340246",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "As if you've ever described a situation as being \"out of control.\" I'm pretty sure any situation you consider to be easy to handle would scare a reasonable person half to death!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340247"
            ]
          },
          "140340247": {
            "id": "140340247",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Guess I'm just used to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340248"
            ]
          },
          "140340248": {
            "id": "140340248",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... You must run into a lot of unexpected situations, then... That explains why you're so good at coming up with things on the spot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340249"
            ]
          },
          "140340249": {
            "id": "140340249",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "As for you, Florian...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340250"
            ]
          },
          "140340250": {
            "id": "140340250",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...I know there's no excuse for what I did. I'll turn myself in to the Gardes at once, confess my crimes, and accept any punishment that comes my way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340251"
            ]
          },
          "140340251": {
            "id": "140340251",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "I would say you've already suffered more than enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340252"
            ]
          },
          "140340252": {
            "id": "140340252",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...What?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340253"
            ]
          },
          "140340253": {
            "id": "140340253",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "You may have been blinded by fame and fortune in the beginning, but your actions during the final battle had proven you to be a true Marechaussee Hunter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340254"
            ]
          },
          "140340254": {
            "id": "140340254",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340255"
            ]
          },
          "140340255": {
            "id": "140340255",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "You'll be far more use to the city above ground than below. Your job as a Hunter is more important.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340256"
            ]
          },
          "140340256": {
            "id": "140340256",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340257"
            ]
          },
          "140340257": {
            "id": "140340257",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Of course, you'll still need to take the keys and pay a personal visit to the two Hunters you wronged. Prepare to accept any terms they give you as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340258"
            ]
          },
          "140340258": {
            "id": "140340258",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...Yes, of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340259"
            ]
          },
          "140340259": {
            "id": "140340259",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "As far as I'm concerned, though... Your showing in the duel was enough to prove your honor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340260"
            ]
          },
          "140340260": {
            "id": "140340260",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "...! Then, I'll do exactly as you said. I... I'll go return those two keys right now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340261"
            ]
          },
          "140340261": {
            "id": "140340261",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "Thank you so much, everyone. I'll do my best to prove myself worthy of the second chance you've given me. I swear this on my name and honor as a Marechaussee Hunter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340262"
            ]
          },
          "140340262": {
            "id": "140340262",
            "speakerId": 14092,
            "speakerName": "Florian",
            "text": "Until we meet again, everyone."
          },
          "140340232": {
            "id": "140340232",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Wait, don't tell me Paimon never...! Ah, this is all my fault. It's not too late to cover your ears! Here, Paimon, I'll do it for you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1403404",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140340301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140340301": {
            "id": "140340301",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Speaking of Marechaussee Hunters... What should we do about the \"treasure\" in that cave?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340302"
            ]
          },
          "140340302": {
            "id": "140340302",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Leave it be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340303"
            ]
          },
          "140340303": {
            "id": "140340303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you sure? We could show it to people, make it so that the Hunters are remembered... Don't you want that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340304"
            ]
          },
          "140340304": {
            "id": "140340304",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "No. Every name on that tablet made the same choice. All Hunters know what the path entails.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340305"
            ]
          },
          "140340305": {
            "id": "140340305",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "I am no exception... My identity as a Marechaussee Hunter is not something I need people to remember. I wish only to be recognized as a Champion Duelist, nothing more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340306"
            ]
          },
          "140340306": {
            "id": "140340306",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "That's certainly very different from the path of a magician. Still, I admire your decision.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340307"
            ]
          },
          "140340307": {
            "id": "140340307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, Paimon just remembered something. If there were no special effects involved, why did our weapons begin to glow during the battle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340308"
            ]
          },
          "140340308": {
            "id": "140340308",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "That's because the Marechaussee Hunters of ages past would often imbue their weapons with special enchantments to suppress the monsters. Whenever a monster was nearby, their weapons would start to glow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340309"
            ]
          },
          "140340309": {
            "id": "140340309",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Ooh! So that's why they had an effect on that guy near the end. I really thought the summons were doing all the work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340310"
            ]
          },
          "140340310": {
            "id": "140340310",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Well, I'm sure the summons were a part of it, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340311"
            ]
          },
          "140340311": {
            "id": "140340311",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Oh? How so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340312"
            ]
          },
          "140340312": {
            "id": "140340312",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "This particular Devorator probably hailed from the same era as the Hunters we saw in the room.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340313"
            ]
          },
          "140340313": {
            "id": "140340313",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "The names you recited all belonged to the bravest Hunters. Countless monsters fell to their blades. That's likely why the Devorator visibly reacted when you said them out loud.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340314"
            ]
          },
          "140340314": {
            "id": "140340314",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So the names held the power all along...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340315"
            ]
          },
          "140340315": {
            "id": "140340315",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340316"
            ]
          },
          "140340316": {
            "id": "140340316",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Navia, everything you said during your \"summon\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340317"
            ]
          },
          "140340317": {
            "id": "140340317",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Huh? Ah—hahaha! I um, I meant what I said. I mean, it was true to my character! So, yeah, I'm glad you heard it, just don't make me repeat myself. It's embarrassing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340318"
            ]
          },
          "140340318": {
            "id": "140340318",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "I really appreciated those words.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340319"
            ]
          },
          "140340319": {
            "id": "140340319",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Alright, alright. Don't get all sentimental on me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340320"
            ]
          },
          "140340320": {
            "id": "140340320",
            "speakerId": 1075,
            "speakerName": "Navia",
            "text": "Uhh... Anyway, let's not talk about that anymore! I'm going to go on ahead. Don't fall too far behind, now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340321"
            ]
          },
          "140340321": {
            "id": "140340321",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah... She ran off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340322"
            ]
          },
          "140340322": {
            "id": "140340322",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "I should probably head back as well. This story was truly incredible. I might have to spend the whole night telling my siblings all about it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340323"
            ]
          },
          "140340323": {
            "id": "140340323",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "See you later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340324"
            ]
          },
          "140340324": {
            "id": "140340324",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Mhm, Goodbye!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340325"
            ]
          },
          "140340325": {
            "id": "140340325",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340326"
            ]
          },
          "140340326": {
            "id": "140340326",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}... Should your name and deeds be forgotten, what do you think the significance of your journey will be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340327"
            ]
          },
          "140340327": {
            "id": "140340327",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340328"
            ]
          },
          "140340328": {
            "id": "140340328",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I suppose the significance would be the journey itself and the world we helped create. There's still value in the time I shared with everyone here, in the things we were able to accomplish, even if no one remembers them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340329"
            ]
          },
          "140340329": {
            "id": "140340329",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "A great answer. I'll remember it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340330"
            ]
          },
          "140340330": {
            "id": "140340330",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What would your answer be, Clorinde?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340331"
            ]
          },
          "140340331": {
            "id": "140340331",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "Me? Hah...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340332"
            ]
          },
          "140340332": {
            "id": "140340332",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "\"The Marechaussee Hunter says nothing in response to that question.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140340333"
            ]
          },
          "140340333": {
            "id": "140340333",
            "speakerId": 1077,
            "speakerName": "Clorinde",
            "text": "\"Perhaps her answer lies in her silence, an unspoken vow left to echo through the night. The path she walks needs no explanation.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
